    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72787cb8c61e89ad3903e436",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……训练员说得对呢。\n至今为止一直在紧绷着弦啊――",
      "source_fingerprint": "de8dade80ded529aeb519afcace18d7519f3fc30f28e9cdcf7bb12d47ff5320f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c26460a63ec40fbaaa046a1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这么定了。那要办个什么样的庆祝会呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "6704541fc532a51805ffbb4173286414e86b8410df304cfadcc5e67bf19ff75d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
